---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro'
import BaseLayout from '~/components/BaseLayout.astro'
import Footer from '~/components/Footer.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy of patwoz.dev"
  lang="en"
>
  <BaseLayout>
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-warm-500 dark:text-warm-400 hover:text-warm-700 dark:hover:text-warm-300 transition-colors mb-8 group"
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        viewBox="0 0 20 20"
        fill="currentColor"
        class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform"
      >
        <path
          fill-rule="evenodd"
          d="M17 10a.75.75 0 01-.75.75H5.612l4.158 3.96a.75.75 0 11-1.04 1.08l-5.5-5.25a.75.75 0 010-1.08l5.5-5.25a.75.75 0 111.04 1.08L5.612 9.25H16.25A.75.75 0 0117 10z"
          clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
      </svg>
      Back to home
    </a>

    <article
      class="animate-fade-in-up opacity-0 prose prose-warm dark:prose-invert max-w-none prose-headings:font-display prose-h1:text-3xl sm:prose-h1:text-4xl prose-h2:mt-10 prose-h2:text-xl prose-p:leading-relaxed"
    >
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-warm-600 dark:text-warm-400">
        This policy explains which personal data is processed when you visit
        <code>patwoz.dev</code> / <code>patwoz.de</code>, on what legal basis,
        and which rights you have as a data subject.
      </p>
      <p class="text-warm-500 dark:text-warm-500 text-sm">
        The legally binding version is the
        <a
          href="/de/datenschutz"
          class="text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 hover:underline"
          >German version</a
        >. This English version is provided for convenience.
      </p>

      <h2>Controller</h2>
      <p>
        Patrick Wozniak<br />
        c/o piparo.tech GmbH<br />
        Frauentorgraben 61<br />
        90443 Nürnberg<br />
        Germany<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:hi@patwoz.de">hi@patwoz.de</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        piparo.tech GmbH does not operate this website. The address is used as a
        forwarding address only.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The website is served via Cloudflare Pages, provided by Cloudflare,
        Inc., 101 Townsend Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA. When the site
        is accessed, technically necessary access data is processed, in
        particular IP address, date and time, requested URL, referrer, browser
        and device information, and technical status information. This
        processing is required in order to deliver the website, ensure security
        and stability, and to prevent misuse. The legal basis is Art. 6 (1) (f)
        GDPR; the legitimate interest is the reliable delivery of the website.
      </p>
      <p>
        Cloudflare, Inc. is based in the USA; accessing the website therefore
        involves a transfer to a third country. The transfer is based on the
        EU-US Data Privacy Framework (adequacy decision of the European
        Commission of 10 July 2023). Cloudflare, Inc. is certified under the
        DPF; the certification status can be checked at <a
          href="https://www.dataprivacyframework.gov/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">www.dataprivacyframework.gov</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2>Plausible Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This website uses a self-hosted instance of Plausible Analytics for
        privacy-friendly, aggregated audience measurement. The script is served
        from the subdomain <code>a.patwoz.dev</code>. Plausible does not use
        cookies and does not build personal user profiles. Aggregate technical
        usage data is processed (page views, referrer, browser, operating
        system, device type, country/region, visit timestamp). A short-lived
        daily hash is derived from IP address and user agent for session
        detection only and is discarded within 24 hours.
      </p>
      <p>
        Legal basis is Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR. The legitimate interest is the
        statistical evaluation of usage, error analysis, and improvement of the
        website. The underlying Plausible instance is operated within the EU.
      </p>

      <h2>Cloudflare Web Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        The website also uses Cloudflare Web Analytics ("Cloudflare Insights")
        operated by Cloudflare, Inc. for cookieless audience measurement. Only
        aggregated performance and usage data is collected (e.g. page views,
        load times, browser and device type). According to Cloudflare, no
        identifying cookies are set and no persistent user profiles are created.
      </p>
      <p>
        Legal basis is Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR; the legitimate interest lies in
        measuring technical performance and analysing usage. With regard to the
        third-country transfer, the statements made above under "Hosting" apply
        accordingly (EU-US Data Privacy Framework).
      </p>

      <h2>Local browser storage</h2>
      <p>
        The website stores the following values locally in your browser for
        convenience functions (no cookie, no transmission to the operator):
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><code>theme</code> – the selected appearance (light/dark).</li>
        <li>
          <code>visited</code> – session storage; suppresses entrance animations
          on repeated visits within a session.
        </li>
        <li>
          <code>lang-hint-dismissed</code> – records that the language hint has already
          been dismissed.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Storage is strictly necessary for the functions requested by the user
        within the meaning of § 25 (2) no. 2 TDDDG. You can delete these entries
        at any time via your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Email contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you contact me by email at <a href="mailto:hi@patwoz.de"
          >hi@patwoz.de</a
        >, the information you submit (in particular email address, content of
        the message, timestamp) is processed in order to answer your request.
        Legal basis is Art. 6 (1) (b) GDPR for contract-related requests and
        Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR otherwise (interest in answering inquiries).
        Correspondence is kept for as long as is necessary to handle and
        document the request and is then deleted, unless statutory retention
        obligations apply.
      </p>

      <h2>Embedded fonts and logos</h2>
      <p>
        Fonts are served locally from the same server that delivers the website;
        no connection to external font providers (e.g. Google Fonts) is
        established. Logos in the "Work" section are embedded locally.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        This website contains links to external services (e.g. GitHub,
        Plausible, OpenStreetMap-based projects). Data is only transmitted to
        the respective provider once you actively click on a link. The privacy
        policies of the respective provider then apply.
      </p>

      <h2>Forwarding address</h2>
      <p>
        Via the forwarding address, piparo.tech GmbH may receive incoming mail
        for Patrick Wozniak and forward it. Sender data, cover letters, delivery
        data and contents of the consignment may be processed to the extent
        necessary for acceptance and forwarding.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Pursuant to the GDPR you have, in particular, the rights to information
        (Art. 15), rectification (Art. 16), erasure (Art. 17), restriction of
        processing (Art. 18), data portability (Art. 20) and objection (Art.
        21). Where processing is based on consent, you may withdraw it at any
        time with effect for the future (Art. 7 (3) GDPR). An informal email to <a
          href="mailto:hi@patwoz.de">hi@patwoz.de</a
        > is sufficient.
      </p>

      <h2>Right to lodge a complaint</h2>
      <p>
        Without prejudice to any other administrative or judicial remedy, you
        have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory
        authority (Art. 77 GDPR). The competent authority for the controller is:
      </p>
      <p>
        Bayerisches Landesamt für Datenschutzaufsicht (BayLDA)<br />
        Promenade 18<br />
        91522 Ansbach, Germany<br />
        <a
          href="https://www.lda.bayern.de"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">www.lda.bayern.de</a
        >
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this privacy policy</h2>
      <p>
        This privacy policy may be adjusted when technology, services used or
        legal requirements change. The version published on this page applies.
      </p>
    </article>

    <Footer />
  </BaseLayout>
</Layout>
